{"id":"cfaecdc022e51c90","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-ATR0.md","title":"Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion System","display":"df-ATR0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-ATR0","aliases":["62-df-ATR0"],"display":"df-ATR0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion System","depends_on":["[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-ATR]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.11.1, V.2.4","source_pages":[39,175],"source_pdf_pages":[57,193]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-ATR0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-ATR0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ATR0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23442ad478f1b29e\" href=\"?note=23442ad478f1b29e\" title=\"62-df-ATR\">62-df-ATR</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.11.1, V.2.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span><span>193</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"23442ad478f1b29e\" href=\"?note=23442ad478f1b29e\" title=\"62-df-ATR\">62-df-ATR</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ATR}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\)</span> 在下式引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ATR0}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\cup\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ATR0}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\cup\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>恢复 Simpson 以 ACA₀ 为基础的确切定义。RCA₀＋ATR 与之可证等价：沿单点良序应用一个忽略前驱集合的任意算术公式即可推出算术理解；再由集合归纳推出算术归纳。仍不加入无条件的完整二阶公式归纳。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions I.11.1, V.2.4；纸面页 39, 175；PDF 页 57, 193。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR","status":"resolved","id":"23442ad478f1b29e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ATR]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-ACA0]]，$\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ATR]]；$\\mathrm{ATR}_0$ 在下式引入。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR","status":"resolved","id":"23442ad478f1b29e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-ACA0]]，$\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ATR]]；$\\mathrm{ATR}_0$ 在下式引入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ACA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ATR}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ATR0}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\cup\\mathrm{ATR}(S_2).","display":true}],"bytes":1095,"backlinks":[{"id":"20465fe6fc759475","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"集合族、模型和理论见 [[62-df-REC-ARITH]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；最小性见 [[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-ATR0|Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion System]]"},{"id":"66d09cd516d4b5e1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；Cn 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]；ARITH 模型分离见 [[62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR]]。"},{"id":"9a759143ad2dba1b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论与 Cn 见 [[62-df-ATR0]]、[[62-df-Pi1-CA0]]、[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]；OmegaModelOf、Beta 见 [[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-beta-model]]；Σ¹₁ 分离刻画见 [[62-thm-ATR0-equivalences]]。"},{"id":"258c57f3152fa88d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；WO 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}$ 见 [[62-df-order-comparison]]，$\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}$ 见 [[62-df-Sigma11-separation]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{CWO}$ 在下式引入。"},{"id":"7afa0fc0e2492bbf","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；Tree、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；截面和函数外延等号见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{UPI}$ 是下式的单个句子。"}],"outgoing":["35af454d9caa8c9d","23442ad478f1b29e"]}